#ETH Every bull market that emerges from a bear market gives rise to truly great opportunities. More often than not, it is not the old narrative being hyped up again, but a new track being rediscovered by the market.

In a bull market, everyone is chasing gains, leaving no time to think;
a bear market, on the other hand, gives us the most valuable things—time and energy.

Time to read code, break down mechanisms, and study data;
energy to research new things that have not yet formed consensus.

01 is at the intersection of V4 Hooks and privacy finance: fair launches, privacy stablecoins, yield-bearing reserves, perpetual buyback and burn, and programmable liquidity.

Whether it will become the next major asset will ultimately be left to the market to decide. But if we only start researching once everyone understands it and the price has already exploded, then we will never have early insight.

So, we choose to go all out for 100 days.

We do not bet on overnight surges; we focus only on long-term research;
we are not swayed by short-term fluctuations; we track only mechanisms and data;
we turn the bear market into understanding, and let time crystallize into consensus.

Only those who can endure will stand out;
those who cannot will be forced out.

In a bear market, time is exchanged for understanding; in a bull market, that understanding may be repriced.

